<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S3.T1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S3.T1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Evaluation results on POPE benchmark across four MLLMs. Results show averaged accuracy and F1 scores in % computed across <span id="S3.T1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">random</span>, <span id="S3.T1.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">popular</span>, and <span id="S3.T1.8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">adversarial</span> object splits. Best and second best results are bolded and underlined, respectively.</span></figcaption>
